# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of platform —
# this repo's CI/deploy targets are all Linux (kaniko builds, GitLab
# Runner), and mixed CRLF/LF checked in by different contributors' local
# core.autocrlf settings produces spurious whole-file diffs and false merge
# conflicts (see the model-pricing code review that added this file).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Known binary assets — no line-ending conversion, no textual diffing.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
